{{!
  Template: credits-used
  Data keys:
    - name           {string}  Recipient's first name
    - creditsUsed    {number}  Amount of credits used
    - creditBalance  {number}  New remaining credit balance
    - usedAt         {string}  Timestamp when credits were used
    - appUrl         {string}  Base URL of the app
    - unsubscribeToken {string}
    - currentYear    {number}
}}
<p class='email-greeting'>Credits Used ✨</p>

<p>
  Hello{{#if name}} {{name}}{{/if}},
</p>

<p>
  You just used <strong>{{creditsUsed}} {{#if (gt creditsUsed 1)}}credits{{else}}credit{{/if}}</strong> to express interest in someone on BreathAway.
</p>

<div class='email-stat-card'>
  <p class='email-stat-card__value'>{{creditsUsed}}</p>
  <p class='email-stat-card__label'>{{#if (gt creditsUsed 1)}}Credits{{else}}Credit{{/if}} Used</p>
</div>

<div style='background-color: #F9FAFB; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 24px 0;'>
  <table style='width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;'>
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Remaining Balance:</td>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #1A1A2E; font-size: 15px;'>{{creditBalance}} credits</td>
    </tr>
    {{#if usedAt}}
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Date &amp; Time:</td>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #6B7280; font-size: 13px;'>{{usedAt}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{/if}}
  </table>
</div>

<p>
  <strong>🔒 100% Confidential</strong><br />
  Remember, your like is strictly private. The other person is never told who liked them — your identities are only revealed when the feeling is mutual and a match is formed!
</p>

<div style='text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;'>
  <a href='{{appUrl}}/credits' class='email-btn'>View My Credits →</a>
</div>

<hr class='email-divider' />

<p style='font-size: 13px; color: #9CA3AF; text-align: center;'>
  Thank you for being part of BreathAway.
</p>
